#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:7 83dbf664b0b54d438c32705215d4651d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Companion Computers can be used to interface and communicate with "
"ArduPilot on a flight controller using the MAVLink protocol.  By doing "
"this your companion computer gets all the MAVLink data produced by the "
"autopilot (including GPS data) and can use it to make intelligent "
"decisions during flight. For example, \"take a photo when the vehicle is "
"at these GPS coordinates\", gather and pre-process information from "
"advanced sensors or actuate lights, auxiliary servos or any other "
"interfaces."
msgstr ""
"伴飞计算机可通过 MAVLink 协议与飞控上的 ArduPilot 进行接口和通信。通过这种方式，伴飞计算机可获取飞控产生的所有 MAVLink"
" 数据（包括 GPS 数据），并利用这些数据在飞行中做出智能决策。例如，「当飞行器到达某 GPS "
"坐标时拍照」、收集和预处理高级传感器信息，或驱动灯光、辅助舵机或其他接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:15
#: e91b972c97774180a73e3e73d97f5a3e
msgid "There are two major parts to Companion Computers - hardware and software."
msgstr "伴飞计算机由两大部分组成：硬件和软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:17
#: 2e78b85af2ea46e68eaf9f03bf5d4688
msgid ""
"The Companion Computer hardware refers to the specific computer hardware "
"being used. This is typically a small ARM-based Single Board Computer. "
"Specific tutorials for popular Companion Computer hardware are listed "
"below."
msgstr "伴飞计算机硬件指所使用的具体计算机硬件，通常是基于 ARM 架构的小型单板计算机。以下列出了常见伴飞计算机硬件的具体教程。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:38
#: 9b954fc55b8548e48cc90d28e36a3832
msgid ""
"The Companion Computer software refers to the programs and tools that run"
" on the Companion Computer. They will take in MAVLink telemetry from the "
"Flight Controller and can route and process the telemetry data. Specific "
"tutorials for popular Companion Computer software tools/suites are listed"
" below."
msgstr ""
"伴飞计算机软件指在伴飞计算机上运行的程序和工具。这些软件从飞控接收 MAVLink "
"数传数据，并可对其进行路由和处理。以下列出了常见伴飞计算机软件工具/套件的具体教程。"

